# Links excluded from automated checking.
#
# One regular expression per line. These are NOT broken links; they are
# endpoints that GitHub Actions runners cannot reliably validate. Each was
# confirmed reachable (HTTP 200) from a normal machine before being listed.
#
# ampcode.com: serves HTTP/2 correctly in normal use, but lychee intermittently
# fails the HTTP/2 handshake from GitHub runners with
# "HTTP/2 protocol error. Server may not support HTTP/2 properly".
https://ampcode\.com/
#
# codebuddy.ai (Tencent CodeBuddy): returns HTTP 200 from normal networks, but
# the host is unreachable from GitHub-hosted runners, which time out after 45s.
https://www\.codebuddy\.ai/
